# Architecture

Three git repos under `apps/`. Do not import source across them. Score math stays in `rayt-me-backend`.

- **Website:** Next.js 16. Browser calls `/backend/*`, rewritten to the API.
- **Backend:** Fastify + Prisma + PostgreSQL. Admin prefix `/admin` (`PLATFORM_ADMIN`). Mobile routes in `src/routes/mobile.ts`.
- **App:** Expo SDK 57, Expo Router. Rating body is `{ relationship, categoryScores }`.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — client writes the new score
await api.post('/ratings', { score: 4.8 })

// ✅ GOOD — server applies calculateReputation
await api.post('/mobile/ratings', { relationship, categoryScores })
```
